<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday! 🎉</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74ebd5, #9ecefa);
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            max-width: 350px;
            width: 85%;
        }
        h1 { color: #ff3366; font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { color: #333; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .btn {
            background: #ff3366;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 10px rgba(255,51,102,0.4);
            width: 100%;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="box">
        <h1>Happy Birthday! 🎂</h1>
        <p>Tu bohot khas hai dost! Bhagwan kare tera ye saal sabse best ho. Hamesha haste rehna! 🥳🎉</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="alert('🎉 Surprise! Happy Birthday Mere Bhai! 🎂 Stay Blessed Always! ❤️')">Click for Surprise ✨</button>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
